[{"t": 0.0, "text": "Good morning everyone. Welcome, let's get started.", "kind": "anchor", "note": "anchor: intro"}, {"t": 5.0, "text": "So, I run a community called OpenSverige.", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "OpenSverige", "body": "", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 10.0, "text": "It's Sweden's open community for AI agents and vibe coding.", "kind": "skip", "note": "repeat of OpenSverige"}, {"t": 16.0, "text": "And it all started in a Discord server. Nothing fancy.", "kind": "slide", "note": "ICON  icon Chat  0.4s", "slide": {"layout": "ICON", "headline": "Discord server", "image_query": "Discord server", "icon": "Chat"}}, {"t": 21.0, "text": "Just a bunch of people who wanted to build things instead of talking about building things.", "kind": "slide", "note": "ICON_GRID    0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "ICON_GRID", "headline": "build things", "body": "instead of talking", "items": ["build things", "instead of talking"], "icons": ["Atom", "Book"], "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 28.0, "text": "Today I want to tell you three things.", "kind": "hold", "note": "announcement: wait for the items"}, {"t": 32.0, "text": "One, we ship. Two, we share. Three, we never wait for permission.", "kind": "slide", "note": "REVEAL_3  One, we ship / Two, we share / Three, we never wait for permission  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "REVEAL_3", "headline": "Three things", "items": ["One, we ship", "Two, we share", "Three, we never wait for permission"], "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 39.0, "text": "People always ask me, how big is it?", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "size of the community", "chart": {"kind": "ring", "values": [50], "labels": ["members"], "illustrative": true}, "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 44.0, "text": "Honestly, it grew faster than anyone expected.", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "faster than expected", "body": "", "icon": "Rocket", "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 49.0, "text": "A year ago we were a handful of friends. Now there are thousands of people in the server.", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.4s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "thousands strong", "body": "", "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 56.0, "text": "And about eighty percent of them have shipped something with an AI agent.", "kind": "slide", "note": "CHART  chart {\"kind\": \"ring\", \"values\": [80], \"labels\": [\"shipped\", \"not shipped\"]} [VIBE]  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "CHART", "headline": "80% shipped AI", "chart": {"kind": "ring", "values": [80], "labels": ["shipped", "not shipped"]}, "claims_fact": true}}, {"t": 62.0, "text": "Which is a crazy number, because ten years ago that would have been zero.", "kind": "hold", "note": "The speaker states a specific percentage (80%) that has shipped something with an AI agent, which matches the recent slide '80% shipped AI [CHART]'. However, the new line provides the context 'ten years ago that would have been zero', which is a comparative fact that can be visualized with a chart showing the change over time. This adds new data (the zero baseline) not covered by the previous chart, so a new chart slide is appropriate to show the contrast."}, {"t": 69.0, "text": "Here's the funny part. Half of our channels are in Swedish.", "kind": "slide", "note": "CHART  chart {\"kind\": \"ring\", \"values\": [50], \"labels\": []}  0.7s", "slide": {"layout": "CHART", "headline": "Swedish channels", "image_query": "Swedish text", "icon": "Language", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false, "chart": {"kind": "ring", "values": [50], "labels": []}}}, {"t": 75.0, "text": "So we built a bot that translates everything into English.", "kind": "slide", "note": "ICON  icon Bot  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "ICON", "headline": "English translation bot", "body": "automatically converts content", "icon": "Bot", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 80.0, "text": "Which means the whole world can now read our arguments about tabs versus spaces.", "kind": "slide", "note": "VERSUS  tabs vs spaces  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "VERSUS", "headline": "tabs versus spaces", "body": "the whole world can read our arguments", "versus": ["tabs", "spaces"], "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 87.0, "text": "Bill, tabs versus spaces", "kind": "slide", "note": "VERSUS  tabs vs spaces  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "VERSUS", "headline": "tabs vs spaces", "body": "Which one do you use?", "versus": ["tabs", "spaces"], "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 93.0, "text": "Now, the real problem in Sweden is that everybody is very polite.", "kind": "slide", "note": "ICON  icon Lightbulb  0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "ICON", "headline": "polite problem", "body": "why it matters", "icon": "Lightbulb", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 99.0, "text": "Nobody wants to say, this idea is bad. They just go, hmm, interesting.", "kind": "slide", "note": "GIF_REACTION  GIF library: terminator-sunglasses.gif  1.3s", "slide": {"layout": "GIF_REACTION", "headline": "Hmm interesting", "body": "", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false, "library_id": "gmv6pb5232"}}, {"t": 106.0, "text": "We call it the Swedish silence.", "kind": "slide", "note": "GIF_REACTION  GIF library: al-pacino.gif  0.7s", "slide": {"layout": "GIF_REACTION", "headline": "Swedish silence", "body": "when everyone is very polite", "gif_query": "silence awkward quiet", "library_id": "gmv6pgz2s6", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 110.0, "text": "Bill, give me the Swedish silence", "kind": "slide", "note": "GIF_REACTION  GIF library: hooah-alpacino.gif  0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "GIF_REACTION", "headline": "Swedish silence", "body": "hmm interesting", "gif_query": "Swedish silence polite nod", "library_id": "gmv6ph0a29", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 116.0, "text": "But when something actually works, people lose their minds.", "kind": "slide", "note": "GIF_REACTION  GIF library: dr-pepper-child.gif  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "GIF_REACTION", "headline": "people lose their minds", "body": "when something actually works", "gif_query": "people cheering excitedly", "library_id": "gmv6pb46p1", "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 122.0, "text": "Last month someone built a full app in one weekend.", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "app in one weekend", "body": "last month", "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 128.0, "text": "Bill, hoo-ah", "kind": "slide", "note": "GIF_REACTION  GIF library: hooah-alpacino.gif  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "GIF_REACTION", "headline": "Hoo-ah", "gif_query": "celebration hooray", "library_id": "gmv6ph0a29", "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 133.0, "text": "Of course, then the AI deleted the database.", "kind": "slide", "note": "GIF_REACTION  GIF library: terminator-t-800.gif  0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "GIF_REACTION", "gif_query": "AI deleting database frustration", "library_id": "gmv6pb5vp3", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 138.0, "text": "Classic. Nothing says vibe coding like a missing production database.", "kind": "slide", "note": "MEME  GIF library: techembass-sverige.png  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "MEME", "headline": "Missing production database", "body": "Classic vibe coding", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false, "library_id": "gmv6pb67z4"}}, {"t": 145.0, "text": "So, what are we building next?", "kind": "slide", "note": "TITLE_CARD    0.4s", "slide": {"layout": "TITLE_CARD", "headline": "what's next", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 150.0, "text": "We want a real place in Stockholm where the community can meet. A proper venue, with real coffee.", "kind": "slide", "note": "PHOTO  photo ok: Wikimedia Commons  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "PHOTO", "headline": "Stockholm meetup spot", "image_query": "coffee shop Stockholm", "icon": "Building2", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 158.0, "text": "And honestly? A taco bar in the lobby.", "kind": "slide", "note": "PHOTO  photo ok: Brokentaco, BY  0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "PHOTO", "headline": "taco bar", "image_query": "taco bar", "icon": "Taco", "mood": "funny", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 164.0, "text": "Bill, how many people live in Sweden?", "kind": "slide", "note": "NUMBER  number 10709292 src  4.0s", "slide": {"layout": "number", "headline": "Sweden Population ~10.7M", "body": "Worldometer July 2026 estimate", "number": 10709292, "items": [], "versus": [], "gif_query": "Sweden population map", "mood": "neutral", "claims_fact": true, "source": "https://www.worldometers.info/world-population/sweden-population"}}, {"t": 172.0, "text": "It's a small country, which is exactly why we move fast.", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "Sweden population", "body": "~10.7M", "mood": "calm", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 178.0, "text": "Our growth over the last three years looked something like this. Slow, slow, boom.", "kind": "slide", "note": "CHART  chart {\"kind\": \"bars\", \"values\": [0, 30, 100], \"labels\": [\"slow\", \"slow\", \"b  0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "CHART", "headline": "growth pattern", "chart": {"kind": "bars", "values": [0, 30, 100], "labels": ["slow", "slow", "boom"], "illustrative": true}, "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 185.0, "text": "And that boom is the AI agents.", "kind": "slide", "note": "CHART  chart {\"kind\": \"bars\", \"values\": [1, 100], \"labels\": [\"slow\", \"boom\"], \"illu  0.6s", "slide": {"layout": "CHART", "headline": "growth spike", "chart": {"kind": "bars", "values": [1, 100], "labels": ["slow", "boom"], "illustrative": true}, "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 190.0, "text": "The future is not a chatbot. It's agents doing the boring work while we do the interesting work.", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.5s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "agents vs chatbot", "body": "interesting work vs boring work", "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 198.0, "text": "If you remember one thing from today, ship it.", "kind": "slide", "note": "BIG_WORD    0.4s", "slide": {"layout": "BIG_WORD", "headline": "ship it", "mood": "hype", "claims_fact": false}}, {"t": 204.0, "text": "Thank you all, see you in the Discord.", "kind": "anchor", "note": "anchor: close"}]